# Longhorn lab: aap's Win95 config plus lab-specific tweaks
Read $HOME/cfg/fvwmrc/fvwm2rc.win95
ImagePath +:$HOME/cfg/fvwm/win2k
# our self-framed clients draw their own frame
Style glassdemo NoTitle, !Handles, BorderWidth 0, !Borders
Style luxshell NoTitle, !Handles, BorderWidth 0, !Borders, Sticky, WindowListSkip, NeverFocus
